messages.text:
The bug is clear. In `src/v4.ts` (and its compiled output `dist-node/v4.js`), the validation check uses `<= 16` instead of `< 16`:

```js
if (rnds.length <= 16) {
    throw new Error('Random bytes length must be >= 16');
}
```

This rejects arrays of exactly 16 bytes, but a valid v4 UUID needs exactly 16 random bytes — so the check should use `< 16`. Let me also check how the build works.

